==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|annuluses}}

# A [[ring]]- or [[donut]]-shaped [[area]] or [[structure]].
# In [[mathematics]], the [[region]] between two concentric [[circle]]s of different [[radius]].
# In [[astronomy]], the ring of the [[sun]] not covered by the [[moon]] in an [[annular eclipse|annular solar eclipse]].
# {{mycology}} The membranous remnants of a [[partial veil]] which leaves a ring on the stem of a mushroom.

